_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af2UX7QlEhCQAtVM8paYNULGDPMz0zZrpo2sf21Ahg-Erw&oe=69F0C1E7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560 x 1440.png", "id": "1314477467235763", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825257_1314477470569096_7800708190831145047_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oC2vPsO53qQQ7kNvwEtGX3R&_nc_oc=AdpN93zk-iNvXQCPAKjaFyOdVcBDMiebWu4q41rg9_kGdTEu3KI5jsp9f_bkHQbOZm0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0Qm-ShGZTjX3jVrsknahKC0FUfbK35d_WPYB4rRvDAAA&oe=69F0B057"}, "display_name": "I Am Mouse : Adventure Simulator", "keywords": ["iam", "mouse", "simulator", "adventure", "iammouse"], "long_description": "**Welcome to I Am Mouse: Your Tiny Adventure Awaits!**\n\n**Pick Your Adventure, Little Mouse!**\n\nChoose from the House, Office, or Space and dive straight into exciting challenges and surprises! Each world has a new adventure waiting for you!\n\n{1159542949524800}\n\n**Cheese Chase: Snatch the Snack!**\nOutsmart RC cars and drones to collect the most cheese in this thrilling, high-speed adventure!\n\n\n{745547554751341}\n\n**Aliens on the Loose? Send in the Mouse!**\n\nJoin the mouse on a galactic adventure, armed with a space gun to blast those pesky aliens!\n\n\n\n{10042326845876356}", "short_description": "Experience life as a tiny explorer in I Am Mouse: Adventure Simulator, a fun and family-friendly VR adventure! Scurry through a house, office, and space station as a curious mouse. Collect cheese, solve small tasks, and discover the world from a whole new perspective. Three interactive maps, tons of surprises, and all the charm of a whiskered hero\u2014your squeaky VR journey starts now!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tretastudios.com/vrprivacypolicy.php", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "TretaStudios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://tretastudios.com/", "c